Description: Certificate Transparency subdomain enumeration and HTTP/S reconnaissance
 ctprobe enumerates certificate-derived subdomains of an apex target from
 Certificate Transparency logs, then probes and classifies their HTTP/S
 reachability. It is intended for authorized security assessments and OSINT
 reconnaissance.
 .
 Features include public-suffix-aware target normalization, a bounded-
 concurrency asynchronous testing engine (aiohttp), fail-closed proxy and Tor
 routing, HTTP status match/filter policies, and txt/json/xlsx output.
 .
 This tool is not an anonymity or evasion tool; --stealth only lowers request
 rate and concurrency. Use it only against systems you are authorized to test.
